1  | ∀x ∃y (¬P(x) ↔ P(y))
   |----
2  | ∃y (¬P(a) ↔ P(y))            ∀ Elim: 1
3  | | [b] ¬P(a) ↔ P(b)
   | |----
4  | | | a=b
   | | |----
5  | | | ¬P(b) ↔ P(b)             = Elim: 3, 4
6  | | | | P(b)
   | | | |----
7  | | | | ¬P(b)                  ↔ Elim: 5, 6
8  | | | | ⊥                      ⊥ Intro: 6, 7
9  | | | ¬P(b)                    ¬ Intro: 6-8
10 | | | P(b)                     ↔ Elim: 5, 9
11 | | | ⊥                        ⊥ Intro: 10, 9
12 | | ¬(a=b)                     ¬ Intro: 4-11
13 | | ∃y ¬(a=y)                  ∃ Intro: 12
14 | | ∃x ∃y ¬(x=y)               ∃ Intro: 13
15 | ∃x ∃y ¬(x=y)                 ∃ Elim: 2, 3-14
